( strain_volume_relative_time and strain_volume_absolute_time in the same
  index (manual 6.1063: "Exactly one ... should be given in the input file,
  not both"), F5 T5 U8. The Professional 02-08-2026 silently uses the
  absolute one: DIVERGENCES STRAIN-VOLUME-BOTH-TABLES.
